### Step 2 — Create These Two Models (Required for Auth)

These are needed because AuthService creates donor/hospital profiles on registration.

**`app/Models/DonorProfile.php`**
```php
<?php

namespace App\Models;

use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Model;

class DonorProfile extends Model
{
    protected $fillable = [
        'user_id',
        'blood_group',
        'date_of_birth',
        'gender',
        'weight_kg',
        'last_donation_date',
        'next_eligible_date',
        'is_eligible',
        'medical_notes',
    ];

    public function user()
    {
        return $this->belongsTo(User::class);
    }
}
```

**`app/Models/HospitalProfile.php`**
```php
<?php

namespace App\Models;

use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Model;

class HospitalProfile extends Model
{
    protected $fillable = [
        'user_id',
        'hospital_name',
        'license_number',
        'city',
    ];

    public function user()
    {
        return $this->belongsTo(User::class);
    }
}
```

